e together holding up peace signs and winking at the viewer. A backgroud would be nice as well! I'm looking forward to working with you!\n\nmy oc: https://imgur.com/a/KgyOUBM", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Vagryu/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 62432, "client_id": 109881, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/90dce96c/uploads/origins/97accbeb-4470-471e-8e07-3f58f454e89e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6904e852a9b5b62d13d307257cb0ef6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/90dce96c/uploads/origins/97accbeb-4470-471e-8e07-3f58f454e89e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6904e852a9b5b62d13d307257cb0ef6, https://si.imgix.net/90dce96c/uploads/origins/97accbeb-4470-471e-8e07-3f58f454e89e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c139b4041907be87e41aeb78d4e7b77d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/90dce96c/uploads/origins/97accbeb-4470-471e-8e07-3f58f454e89e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=53ac0303bd762fa9910044e84eed3290 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/90dce96c/uploads/origins/97accbeb-4470-471e-8e07-3f58f454e89e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f82aa328d25ef3b62b2f960954c91f20", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/90dce96c/uploads/origins/97accbeb-4470-471e-8e07-3f58f454e89e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f82aa328d25ef3b62b2f960954c91f20, https://si.imgix.net/90dce96c/uploads/origins/97accbeb-4470-471e-8e07-3f58f454e89e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7dc39057e277d29de029cad9166ed05c 2x, https://si.imgix.n